'''Elementalist [[Vabbian armor]]''' is a [[Prestige armor|prestige]] art type available in the Nightfall campaign. This is the only elementalist armor which has a unique set of [[Elementalist_headgear#Nightfall_prestige_headgear_art|headgear art]].

There is no standard version of Vabbian armor.

